[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13740.389, "timestamp": "03:49:00", "text": "不，这就像实践课一样……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13742.79, "timestamp": "03:49:02", "text": "我们正在研究的这个科目的实验室资料"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13744.06, "timestamp": "03:49:04", "text": "学习中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13745.51, "timestamp": "03:49:05", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13747.03, "timestamp": "03:49:07", "text": "所以基本上我们所做的就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13749.269, "timestamp": "03:49:09", "text": "就像我们会告诉你的那样，这基本上就像测试一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13751.189, "timestamp": "03:49:11", "text": "你知道你就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13753.99, "timestamp": "03:49:13", "text": "实际上就像对待这些科目一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13755.75, "timestamp": "03:49:15", "text": "所以在那之后，我们就会像我们的主要业务一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13764.07, "timestamp": "03:49:24", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13768.79, "timestamp": "03:49:28", "text": "我的意思是，我已经很喜欢我早期的所有作品了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13778.229, "timestamp": "03:49:38", "text": "很高兴今天能安排好时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13781.349, "timestamp": "03:49:41", "text": "因为我当时想的是，“哦，不。”当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13783.389, "timestamp": "03:49:43", "text": "首先结束了，我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13787.11, "timestamp": "03:49:47", "text": "比如，“呃，等等。”我当时想，“哦，等等。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13788.349, "timestamp": "03:49:48", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13792.229, "timestamp": "03:49:52", "text": "嗯，我当时就想，等等，我当时就想，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13794.83, "timestamp": "03:49:54", "text": "是的，这就像是为了"}]